    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv-non-isa/riscv-elf-psabi-doc/pulls/comments/2275805172",
    "pull_request_review_id": 3119450758,
    "id": 2275805172,
    "node_id": "PRRC_kwDOBFaCKM6Hpgf0",
    "diff_hunk": "@@ -493,6 +509,17 @@ The alignment of `max_align_t` is 16.\n Structs and unions are aligned to the alignment of their most strictly aligned\n member. The size of any object is a multiple of its alignment.\n \n+==== _BitInt (N)\n+\n+`_BitInt (N)` is the type defined in C23, allow user to define an\n+arbitrary-sized integer type, where N is a postive integer larger than zero.\n+\n+`_BitInt(N)` types are stored in little-endian order in memory. Bits in each\n+byte are allocated from low to high.\n+",
    "path": "riscv-cc.adoc",
    "commit_id": "062f87e8cf5bb794e8da21f91cf68b45ced92fdf",
    "original_commit_id": "9e2e1d963f2823be79a94b3957229dd7e80751c9",
    "user": {
      "login": "xypron",
      "id": 2747104,
      "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDcxMDQ=",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2747104?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/xypron",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/xypron",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/xypron/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/xypron/following{/other_user}",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/xypron/gists{/gist_id}",
