    "body": "I guess same situation for _BitInt(32) and _BitInt(64), that probably cause problem for those simple arithmetic, I mean we can't use simple instruction to do add or sub for _BitInt(32) and _BitInt(64) on big endian.\r\nso that sounds better way to follow the endianness of the system, thanks for suggestion! ",
